# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Keep These Important Files (Override above rules)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Documentation - Always commit
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!LICENSE
!**/*.md

# Essential Config Files (structure only, no secrets)
!App.js/android/app/build.gradle
!App.js/android/build.gradle
!App.js/android/settings.gradle
!App.js/android/gradle.properties
!App.js/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
!App.js/android/app/proguard-rules.pro

# Firebase rules (team needs these!)
!App.js/firestore.rules
!App.js/storage.rules
!App.js/firestore-dev.rules

# Package files
!package.json
!package-lock.json

