# Keep archive for project history reference
# _ Archive/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TEAM NOTE: Files You Must Create Locally
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# After cloning, each developer must:
# 1. Get google-services.json from Firebase Console
# 2. Create src/constants/config.js with API keys
# 3. Set up local.properties for Android SDK path
# 
# See: README.md and TEAM_SETUP.md for detailed instructions
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Turborepo / Next
.turbo/
**/.next/
!.env.example
